error[NK1104]: This lambda returns `ref String`, a view, but `fn() -> String` returns text of its own.
   --> tests/ownership_matrix_view_kept_lambda_result.nika:17:34
    |
 17 |     let f: fn() -> String = fn { s }
    |                                  ^
